256
00:09:31,552 --> 00:09:33,751
A factory performance truck,

257
00:09:33,751 --> 00:09:35,244
in limited numbers.

258
00:09:35,594 --> 00:09:38,550
According to Ford Authority in February twenty

259
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:41,186
twenty-six, the average value of a number

260
00:09:41,186 --> 00:09:44,914
two condition second-generation Lightning went from around

261
00:09:44,914 --> 00:09:47,742
twenty thousand dollars in twenty sixteen to

262
00:09:47,742 --> 00:09:51,406
forty-eight thousand seven hundred by twenty twenty-four.

263
00:09:51,586 --> 00:09:54,287
The first generation went from around fifteen

264
00:09:54,287 --> 00:09:56,927
thousand to forty-two thousand four hundred.

265
00:09:57,107 --> 00:09:59,425
Both more than doubled in about eight

266
00:09:59,425 --> 00:09:59,800
years.

267
00:10:00,151 --> 00:10:03,139
The Lightning shows another rule of truck

268
00:10:03,139 --> 00:10:04,086
collectibles.

269
00:10:04,266 --> 00:10:07,605
Limited factory performance models from a big

270
00:10:07,605 --> 00:10:09,236
brand tend to do well,

271
00:10:09,236 --> 00:10:12,278
because they combine rarity with a famous

272
00:10:12,278 --> 00:10:12,649
