377
00:14:24,589 --> 00:14:26,851
A collectible with history,

378
00:14:26,851 --> 00:14:28,862
still at an entry price.

379
00:14:29,212 --> 00:14:31,650
Notice the pattern in these mentions.

380
00:14:31,830 --> 00:14:34,385
The four fifty-four S S has already

381
00:14:34,385 --> 00:14:35,115
taken off.

382
00:14:35,295 --> 00:14:37,586
The Syclone has taken off for the

