The Li'l Red Express has not yet.

385
00:14:40,868 --> 00:14:42,869
If you are looking for the next

386
00:14:42,869 --> 00:14:45,000
one, look for trucks with a great

387
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:46,872
story and limited production,

388
00:14:46,872 --> 00:14:48,937
whose prices have not moved yet.

389
00:14:49,117 --> 00:14:51,671
That is where early buyers find value.

390
00:14:52,022 --> 00:14:53,813
Now the twist we promised,

391
00:14:53,813 --> 00:14:56,155
the so-called instant collectible.

392
00:14:56,335 --> 00:14:58,366
In April twenty twenty-two,

393
00:14:58,366 --> 00:15:01,376
the first production Ford Bronco Raptor,

394
00:15:01,376 --> 00:15:03,934
chassis number zero zero zero one,

395
